Package: vesta-temple
Version: 2779.1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: armatos-voice, curl, python3, apt (>= 1.9.11)
Maintainer: factionparadox <factionparadox@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: keeps Discord's flame burning
 An installer package for Discord. It contains no Discord code: on install,
 and whenever cursus collects tribute, it fetches the official .deb from
 discord.com and installs it with apt. It also stops Discord's own update
 nag, since updates now arrive with the rest of the system.
 .
 Removing vesta-temple leaves Discord installed; remove the "discord"
 package to remove Discord itself.
